@@ -0,0 +1,229 @@
+# Copyright (c) 2006,2007 Mitch Garnaat http://garnaat.org/
+# Copyright (c) 2011 Chris Moyer http://coredumped.org/
+#
+# Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a
