+"""utilities methods and classes for checkers
+
+Base id of standard checkers (used in msg and report ids):
+01: base
+02: classes
+03: format
+04: import
+05: misc
+06: variables
+07: exceptions
+08: similar
+09: design_analysis
+10: newstyle
+11: typecheck
+12: logging
+13: string_format
